    Yaw rotation of scene conditioning + --rotate-deg eval diagnostic
    
    - src/data/yaw_rotation.py: POSE_KEYS, azimuth_rotation_matrix, and
      rotate_scene_metadata -- roll the equirectangular depth panorama by the
      quantised column shift and rotate its stored per-pixel vectors and the pose
      fields about z by the same effective angle (exact, no interpolation; the
      input dict is never mutated; pose_keys selects which pose fields rotate)
    - eval_FLAC.py: optional --rotate-deg rotates the conditioning (depth + poses)
      before the conditioner call while the target RIR and context_audio stay
      fixed; rotate_deg lands in the metrics JSON and a _rot<deg> filename suffix
      keeps rotated runs from overwriting the unrotated record
    - tests: pose_keys contract; panorama-consistency invariant at 90/180/270 and
      37.3 deg with a hand-built wrong-sign negative control; alpha_eff
      quantisation (dj=53 @ 37.3 deg, dj=128 @ 90 deg); pose/depth co-rotation;
      non-mutation contract
    
